{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393950/extras/c6c188a46dae3d9817811be5c3a8d524.poster.avif?t=1753760526\" width=696 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393950/extras/c6c188a46dae3d9817811be5c3a8d524.webm?t=1753760526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393950/extras/c6c188a46dae3d9817811be5c3a8d524.mp4?t=1753760526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Light Odyssey is a <strong>Boss-Rush Action</strong> game about taking down the Colossus of Light. <br>You find yourself at the edge of time in a demised civilization, and the only thing you can rely on is a dimming light. <br><br>Light Odyssey captures the interplay of light and darkness that strikes out as one of many distinctive graphic features, along with a fast-paced combat system, and an epic storyline in which you have to strike down gigantic enemies.<br>What transpired in these ancient ruins, and what is the origin of the formidable power wielded by the colossus who guard this place?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You must defeat the colossi and restore light into the world.</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Discover dormant colossi in rock, fire, ice, and more.<br></li><li>Experience the unique combat system, cinematic, and challenges that require quick decisions.<br></li><li>Learn new combat and passive skills that will assist you in battle.<br></li><li>Uncover ancient secrets by deciphering symbols found in ancient ruins.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2393950?t=1753760526","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2393950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753760526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_